<section class="phero"><img class="phero-img" src="/assets/img/photos/contractor-belt.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/contractor-belt-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/contractor-belt.webp 960w" sizes="100vw" width="960" height="640" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><div class="wrap"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">›</span><span aria-current="page">Services</span></nav><p class="tag">What we do</p><h1>Insurance Appraisal Services Across Nebraska</h1><p class="lede">From a one-time estimate review to full panel representation and neutral umpire work, every Nebraska Insurance Appraiser service is built around an accurate, defensible valuation of your loss.</p><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn gold" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg><span>Call (844) 537-1427</span></a><a class="btn line-light" href="/free-claim-review/">Free claim review</a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="lgrid" data-stagger><a class="lcard rv" href="/appraisal-services-nebraska/appraisal-demand-representation/"><img class="lcard-img" src="/assets/img/photos/consultation.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/consultation-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/consultation.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:760px) 100vw, 260px" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="lcard-b"><span class="kicker">Service 01</span><h2>Appraisal Demand Representation</h2><p>Named as your appraiser after a written appraisal demand, from first inspection to signed award.</p></span></a><a class="lcard rv" href="/appraisal-services-nebraska/homeowner-claim-appraiser/"><img class="lcard-img" src="/assets/img/photos/craftsman-home.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/craftsman-home-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/craftsman-home.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:760px) 100vw, 260px" width="1024" height="684" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="lcard-b"><span class="kicker">Service 02</span><h2>Homeowner Claim Appraiser</h2><p>Independent valuation for houses, townhomes and acreages when the carrier’s estimate falls short.</p></span></a><a class="lcard rv" href="/appraisal-services-nebraska/commercial-hoa-claim-appraisal/"><img class="lcard-img" src="/assets/img/photos/condo-building.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/condo-building-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/condo-building.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:760px) 100vw, 260px" width="1024" height="768" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="lcard-b"><span class="kicker">Service 03</span><h2>Commercial &amp; HOA Claim Appraisal</h2><p>Valuation for retail, office, multifamily, churches and HOA properties with large or complex losses.</p></span></a><a class="lcard rv" href="/appraisal-services-nebraska/hail-roof-appraisal/"><img class="lcard-img" src="/assets/img/photos/hailstones.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/hailstones-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/hailstones.webp 768w" sizes="(max-width:760px) 100vw, 260px" width="768" height="1024" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="lcard-b"><span class="kicker">Service 04</span><h2>Hail &amp; Roof Appraisal</h2><p>Slope-by-slope hail documentation, test squares, soft metals and repairability for Nebraska roofs.</p></span></a><a class="lcard rv" href="/appraisal-services-nebraska/tornado-straight-line-wind-appraisal/"><img class="lcard-img" src="/assets/img/photos/tornado-street.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/tornado-street-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/tornado-street.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:760px) 100vw, 260px" width="1024" height="768" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="lcard-b"><span class="kicker">Service 05</span><h2>Tornado &amp; Straight-Line Wind Appraisal</h2><p>Valuation of tornado, derecho and downburst damage to roofs, siding, structures and trees.</p></span></a><a class="lcard rv" href="/appraisal-services-nebraska/farm-ranch-outbuilding-appraisal/"><img class="lcard-img" src="/assets/img/photos/grain-bin-wreck.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/grain-bin-wreck-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/grain-bin-wreck.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:760px) 100vw, 260px" width="1200" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="lcard-b"><span class="kicker">Service 06</span><h2>Farm &amp; Ranch Outbuilding Appraisal</h2><p>Machine sheds, pole barns, grain bins and shops on farm or acreage policies after storm damage.</p></span></a><a class="lcard rv" href="/appraisal-services-nebraska/water-damage-claim-appraisal/"><img class="lcard-img" src="/assets/img/photos/ceiling-water.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/ceiling-water-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/ceiling-water.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:760px) 100vw, 260px" width="1200" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="lcard-b"><span class="kicker">Service 07</span><h2>Water Damage Claim Appraisal</h2><p>Sudden leaks, burst lines and storm-driven water: drywall, flooring, cabinets and drying costs.</p></span></a><a class="lcard rv" href="/appraisal-services-nebraska/fire-smoke-damage-appraisal/"><img class="lcard-img" src="/assets/img/photos/house-fire.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/house-fire-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/house-fire.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:760px) 100vw, 260px" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="lcard-b"><span class="kicker">Service 08</span><h2>Fire &amp; Smoke Damage Appraisal</h2><p>Structure fires, smoke migration, soot cleaning and contents after house, shop or grassland fires.</p></span></a><a class="lcard rv" href="/appraisal-services-nebraska/ice-dam-frozen-pipe-appraisal/"><img class="lcard-img" src="/assets/img/photos/icicles.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/icicles-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/icicles.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:760px) 100vw, 260px" width="1200" height="1352" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="lcard-b"><span class="kicker">Service 09</span><h2>Ice Dam &amp; Frozen Pipe Appraisal</h2><p>Winter losses from ice dams, burst pipes and snow load across Nebraska’s long cold season.</p></span></a><a class="lcard rv" href="/appraisal-services-nebraska/carrier-estimate-review/"><img class="lcard-img" src="/assets/img/photos/calculator-laptop.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/calculator-laptop-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/calculator-laptop.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:760px) 100vw, 260px" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="lcard-b"><span class="kicker">Service 10</span><h2>Carrier Estimate Review</h2><p>A line-by-line review of the insurer’s estimate before you decide whether to supplement or demand appraisal.</p></span></a><a class="lcard rv" href="/appraisal-services-nebraska/umpire-selection-services/"><img class="lcard-img" src="/assets/img/photos/review-meeting.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/review-meeting-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/review-meeting.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:760px) 100vw, 260px" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="lcard-b"><span class="kicker">Service 11</span><h2>Umpire Selection &amp; Services</h2><p>Help choosing a qualified neutral umpire, and neutral umpire work where we represent neither side.</p></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec tint"><div class="wrap two top"><div class="rv"><p class="tag">Not sure where to start?</p><h2>Most claims begin with an estimate review</h2><p>Before anyone demands appraisal, it helps to know where the carrier’s estimate falls short and what that gap is worth. A review answers that in days, and many disputes close at that stage.</p><a class="btn navy" href="/appraisal-services-nebraska/carrier-estimate-review/">About estimate reviews <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div><div class="rv"><div class="faq"><details><summary>Can I hire you for just one step?</summary><div class="a"><p>Yes. Many clients start with an estimate review and decide later whether to demand appraisal.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do you handle farm and commercial claims?</summary><div class="a"><p>Yes. Homes, acreages, farms, HOAs, apartments, churches and commercial buildings.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do you only work on hail?</summary><div class="a"><p>No. We handle wind, tornado, water, freeze, fire and other covered perils.</p></div></details></div></div></div></section>
<section class="cta-strip"><div class="wrap rv"><div><h2>Have a claim that doesn’t add up?</h2><p>Send the carrier’s estimate. We’ll review it and tell you what we see.</p></div><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn gold" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg><span>(844) 537-1427</span></a><a class="btn line-light" href="/free-claim-review/">Email the estimate</a></div></div></section>
